    web_render_space_layoutunit_tie_2026-11-27, 0, "2026-11-27 w5-5: fix implemented across layout_foundation.spl (pub layout_unit_ceil_milli with <= 0 guard and LayoutUnit-ceiled space_m/lead_m/trail_m in inline_item_width_err_milli) and layout_engine.spl (layout_unit_ceil_milli on lead_milli pen carry); updated AC-20 (m6) in inline_line_end_space_align_chrome159_spec.spl and added Bug 5 unit test (4445->4454, 0->0, -500->0, and pen carry parity) in layout_engine_w5_5_chrome159_fixes_spec.spl. Windows host interpreter: layout_engine_w5_5_chrome159_fixes_spec 5/5 passed; inline_line_end_space_align_chrome159_spec 9/24 passed (15 Linux TTF metric assertions including AC-20 fail without Linux TTF assets). waiting-for: Linux Chrome 159 TTF verification"

